%% Sequence Diagram — a ₹5L+ request escalating all the way to Final Authority
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor H as Head / Activity In-charge
    participant UI as Web App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant WE as Workflow Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant NS as Notification Service
    actor P as Principal
    actor C as CDC (Grant + Non-Grant)
    actor F as Chairman + Vice Chairman

    H->>UI: Fill request, add budget items
    UI->>API: POST /requests (items[], budget_head, FY)
    API->>DB: INSERT requests + request_items
    Note over DB: CHECK requested_quantity > 0
    API-->>UI: 201 request_number REQ-1024 (DRAFT)

    H->>UI: Submit
    UI->>API: POST /requests/REQ-1024/submit
    API->>WE: routeStage(total = ₹6,00,000)
    WE->>DB: SELECT fn_route_stage(600000)
    DB-->>WE: stage = CDC
    WE->>DB: UPDATE status = UNDER_CDC_REVIEW
    WE->>DB: INSERT approval_actions (SUBMIT)
    WE->>NS: notify(stage = CDC)
    NS->>DB: INSERT notifications
    NS--)C: Email / in-app alert

    C->>UI: Open REQ-1024, review items
    C->>UI: Comment "Grant budget unavailable"
    UI->>API: POST /requests/REQ-1024/comments (visibility = UP_CHAIN)
    API->>DB: INSERT comments
    Note over DB: Visible to CDC and above,<br/>not to Purchase Committee or Head

    C->>UI: Escalate
    UI->>API: POST /requests/REQ-1024/actions (ESCALATE)
    API->>WE: escalate(request, actor)
    WE->>DB: INSERT approval_actions (ESCALATE) + digital_signatures
    WE->>DB: UPDATE status = UNDER_FINAL_AUTHORITY_REVIEW
    WE->>NS: notify(stage = FINAL_AUTHORITY)
    NS--)F: Email / in-app alert

    F->>UI: Approve 3 of 5 items, ₹2,50,000 of ₹6,00,000
    UI->>API: POST /requests/REQ-1024/actions (PARTIAL_APPROVE, decisions[])
    API->>WE: applyPartialApproval(request, decisions)
    WE->>DB: INSERT approval_actions + approval_action_items
    Note over DB: requested_quantity untouched,<br/>approved_quantity and approved_amount written
    WE->>DB: UPDATE request_items.item_status
    WE->>DB: UPDATE requests SET status = PARTIALLY_APPROVED,<br/>sanctioned_amount = 250000
    WE->>DB: INSERT audit_logs
    WE->>NS: notify(requester + Principal)
    NS--)P: Decision recorded
    NS--)H: "Partially approved — ₹2,50,000 sanctioned"

    H->>UI: View request timeline
    UI->>API: GET /requests/REQ-1024/timeline
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM v_request_timeline
    DB-->>API: Full chronological trail
    API-->>UI: Timeline with signatures and amounts
